{"articleNo":"1628","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1628&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[모집] 2011년 1/4분기 창업진흥센터 입주기업 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.03.03","hit":"9112","attachments":[{"name":"입주신청서양식총괄(신청서,사업계획서,요약서).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1628&attachNo=71057"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"4\">금오공과대학교 창업진흥센터 입주기업 모집</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 14.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;금오공과대학교 창업진흥센터는 3년 연속(2007~2009)으로 “경상북도 스타벤처기업”을 배출한 명문 기업지원기관입니다. 대구․경북지방중소기업청, 구미시, 경상북도, 경북테크노파크 등과 연계하여 예비창업자와 신규창업자의 창업성공을 위해 노력하고 있으며, 중소기업청 『예비기술창업자육성사업』의 주관기관으로서 예비창업자와 신규창업자에게 창업성공을 위한 최선의 선택이 될 것입니다. </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">1. 모집분야</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;그린에너지, 의료기기, 전자/기계, S/W 등&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">2. 입주자격</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 예비창업자 또는 창업 2년 미만의 기술기반 기업</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 입주 후 사업장 주소지는 금오공과대학교로 하여야 함 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">3. 모집일정</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 신청접수 : 공고일 ~ 2011년 3월 21일(월)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 현장심사 : 2011년 3월 4째주경(1차 서류 심사 후 별도통보)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 심사위원 : 유관기관 관계자 5인 내외</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">4. 입주혜택</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 1:1 전담교수제를 통한 기술지원</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 특허, 교육, 장비, 자금 등 연계 지원</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 유관기관 및 기업 간 인적 교류 지원</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 기타 창업성공을 위한 지원활동</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">5. 접수방법</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">◦ 첨부된 입주신청서 작성 후 e-mail 제출(hello@kumoh.ac.kr)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -52.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">6. 문의</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 금오공과대학교 창업진흥센터</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교 이오스관 313호</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;◦ 054-478-6941~2, </font></span><a href=\"http://bic.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">http://bic.kumoh.ac.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEI